{"unit_id":"forgotfish__dsh-cx-learn#card-zh","repo":"forgotfish/dsh-cx-learn","commit":"90c81a5f90b7600164565c4483a8751355fbdbb1","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"cx-learn 是面向 DSH 网页端的学习通课程插件。它通过设置页和本地接口连接 Chromium，支持扫码登录、读取课程、选择章节并推进视频播放，也能显示运行状态和日志、安全停止任务及生成题目审阅草稿。适合在 DSH 中管理学习通课程播放；需要学习通账号、Node.js 和 Chromium。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1395-1512","client.js:692-702","engine/src/courses.js:533-549"]}
{"unit_id":"forgotfish__dsh-cx-learn#card-en","repo":"forgotfish/dsh-cx-learn","commit":"90c81a5f90b7600164565c4483a8751355fbdbb1","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"cx-learn is a DSH web plugin for Chaoxing courses. Its settings panel connects Chromium for QR login, course listing, chapter playback, task controls, status, logs, and question review drafts. Use it to manage course playback through DSH. A Chaoxing account, Node.js, and Chromium are required.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1395-1512","client.js:692-702","engine/src/courses.js:533-549"]}
